<facsimile><graphic url="https://www.e-manuscripta.ch/i3f/v20/1079151/manifest"/></facsimile><text><body><div type="letter">
<pb facs="1079152" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute>Viro <choice><abbr>Celeberr.</abbr><expan>Celeberrimo</expan></choice> et Clarissimo
      <lb/>Petro Antonio <rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Michelotti</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/><choice><abbr>Joh.</abbr><expan>Johannes</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Bernoull<choice><orig><g ref="#j">j</g></orig><reg>i</reg></choice></rs>.</salute></opener>
  <p><lb/>Crastina Deo dante die aggressurus est <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">filius</rs> meus iter suum
      <lb/>ad Lares vestros; spero fore, ut divin<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> annuente gratia salvus
      <lb/>Te salvum inveniat; tradet Tibi doctissimam Tuam <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">Dis<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>sertationem</rs> cum variis aliis schediasmatibus, accipies enim
      <lb/>1<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice><hi rend="sup">o</hi> Animadversiones<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Bernoulli schrieb seine Anmerkungen gesondert nieder. Was er für Schreib- oder Rechenversehen hielt, korrigierte er im Manuskript mit Bleistift. Michelotti bestätigt den Empfang der Anmerkungen im Postskriptum vom 17. Mai zu seinem <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515150805501">Brief</rs> vom 10. Mai 1720. Die UB Basel bewahrt Anmerkungen Bernoullis zu Michelottis Dissertation auf (<ref target="https://swisscollections.ch/Record/991170521852705501">L Ia 13, Nr. 13</ref>). Der Katalog datiert sie auf 1721–1748. Ihr Verhältnis zu den hier angekündigten Anmerkungen bleibt offen.</note> meas in Tuam illam <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">dissertationem</rs>;
      <lb/>2<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice><choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice><hi rend="sup">do</hi> alteram meam animadversionem<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Bernoulli hatte seine Anmerkung zu Jurins Abhandlung bereits einem früheren Schreiben beigelegt. Eine Abschrift von der Hand Daniel I Bernoullis ist in der UB Basel erhalten (<ref target="https://doi.org/10.7891/e-manuscripta-77666">L Ia 750, Bl. 314–317</ref>). In <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_M3G2JA79"><hi rend="i">De separatione fluidorum</hi></rs> (1721, p. 128) führt Michelotti gegen Jurins Modell eines sich verengenden Wasserstroms im Gefäss ein Argument Johann I Bernoullis an.</note> <rs type="letter">prioribus</rs> annexam
      <lb/>in <choice><abbr>Jac.</abbr><expan>Jacobi</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-119507978" type="person">Jurini</rs> <choice><orig>dissertationem</orig><reg>Dissertationem</reg></choice> <rs key="biblio_M6Z9EVAL" type="biblio">de motu aquarum fluen<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tium</rs>. 3<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice><choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice><choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice><hi rend="sup">tio</hi> notas meas in <choice><abbr>Jac.</abbr><expan>Jacobi</expan></choice> <rs key="pers_DE-588-1055365613" type="person">Keilii</rs> <rs key="biblio_22EK4JD4" type="biblio"><choice><orig>tentamen</orig><reg>Tentamen</reg></choice> de
      <lb/>vi cordis sanguinem per universum corpus impellentis</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Anmerkungen Johann I Bernoullis zu dieser Abhandlung sind von der Hand Daniel I Bernoullis überliefert (UB Basel, <ref target="https://doi.org/10.7891/e-manuscripta-77667">L Ia 750, Bl. 310–313</ref>). Ob die Handschrift der hier angekündigten Fassung entspricht, bleibt offen.</note>;
      <lb/>4<hi rend="sup">to</hi> Ejusdem <rs key="pers_DE-588-1055365613" type="person">Keilii</rs> <choice><orig>tentamen</orig><reg>Tentamen</reg></choice> de motu musculorum
      <lb/>cum notis marginalibus <rs key="pers_DE-588-118656503" type="person">filii</rs> mei natu minoris, qui
      <lb/>jam per aliquot annos studio medico operam navat;
      <lb/>si h<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c omnia Tibi placeant impens<choice><orig><g ref="#eacut">é</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> gaudebo,
      <lb/>illa Tui juris facio, ex quibus sumere poteris, quicquid
      <lb/>in rem Tuam faciet, ita ut pro lubitu loca
      <lb/>notata in Dissertatione <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">de separatione fluidorum</rs>
      <lb/>vel mutare vel ut sunt relinquere possis prout
      <lb/>Tibi visum fuerit; in hunc finem nihil in scripto
      <lb/>Tuo delevi, sed qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> annotavi separatim in chartam
      <lb/>conjeci, exceptis tamen quibusdam, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> omnino in
      <lb/>ipso scripto corrigenda putavi, quia ea consideravi
<pb facs="1079153" n="2"/>
      <lb/>tanquam lapsus sive calculi sive calami, id vero ut di<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>gnoscas assumsi plumbaginem non atramentum.
      <lb/>Facile permittam ut cum Tua <rs key="biblio_M3G2JA79" type="biblio">Dissertatione</rs> in public<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice>
      <lb/>prodeant simul qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>dam ex meis <rs key="biblio_W6BHQDM2 biblio_JAFFCHKU biblio_WIW87HR7" type="biblio">Dissertationibus</rs>,
      <lb/>si eas dignas judicaveris, sed optarim, ut emendes
      <lb/>quasdam locutiones, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> Tibi in illis occurrent, qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> non
      <lb/>sunt satis latin<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> vel qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> omnino sunt barbar<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>,
      <lb/>quales haud dubie plures reperien<choice><orig><g ref="#tur">&#xf199;</g></orig><reg>tur</reg></choice> in <choice><abbr>Diss.</abbr><expan>Dissertatione</expan></choice> <rs key="biblio_W6BHQDM2" type="biblio">de <choice><abbr>Efferv.</abbr><expan>Effervescentia</expan></choice>
      <lb/>et <choice><abbr>ferment.atione</abbr><expan>fermentatione</expan></choice></rs> utpote quam composui in prima juven<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tute cum vix haberem 20 vel 22<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice> annos; quam conscripsi
      <lb/><rs key="biblio_JAFFCHKU" type="biblio">de Motu musculorum</rs> et alteram <rs key="biblio_WIW87HR7" type="biblio">de nutritione</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Im <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515150605501">Brief</rs> vom 18. Juli 1720 erklärte Michelotti, er stelle die Veröffentlichung dieser Schrift aus Zeitmangel zurück. Er wollte sie später zusammen mit eigenen Beispielen zur Anwendung der Lehre von der tierischen Sekretion auf menschliche Krankheiten herausgeben. In die venezianischen <rs type="biblio" key="biblio_LUTG2JUY"><hi rend="i">Dissertationes physico-mechanicae</hi></rs> von 1721 nahm er die beiden zuerst genannten Schriften auf.</note>, spero
      <lb/>latinitatem earum minus barbaram esse, non tamen
      <lb/>dubito et has castigatione qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice>dam opus habere, id
      <lb/>vero prudenti Tuo consilio relinquo. In postremis
      <lb/>meis <rs type="letter">litteris</rs> rogabam Te, ut mihi indicares, utrum
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-118656503" type="person">filius</rs> meus secundus <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> occasionem habiturus
      <lb/>esset studium suum Medicum prosequendi et
      <lb/>pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>sertim in praxi sese exercendi, quo casu
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-118656503" type="person">illum</rs> una cum <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">fratre</rs> suo in <rs key="place_KON-italie" type="place">Italiam</rs> misissem,
      <lb/>sed cum ad hanc qu<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>stionem nullum responsum
      <lb/>acceperim, illum apud me retineo. C<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>terum
      <lb/>Te officios<choice><orig><g ref="#eacut">é</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice> rogatum volo, ut meum <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">Nicola<choice><orig><g ref="#um">ū</g></orig><reg>um</reg></choice></rs>
      <lb/>Tibi commendatum habeas eum<choice><orig><g ref="#que">&#xe8bf;</g></orig><reg>que</reg></choice> co<choice><orig><g ref="#mm">&#xE5D2;</g></orig><reg>mm</reg></choice>endes
<pb facs="1079154" n="3"/>
      <lb/>aliis quorum Patrocinio indigebit, inprimis <choice><abbr>Nobiliss.</abbr><expan>Nobilissimo</expan></choice>
      <lb/>et <choice><abbr>Excell.</abbr><expan>Excellentissimo</expan></choice> illi viro patritio, qui <rs key="pers_DE-588-117589144" type="person">filium</rs> meum ad se
      <lb/>accersivit, ut ejus oper<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> uta<choice><orig><g ref="#tur">&#xf199;</g></orig><reg>tur</reg></choice> in addiscendis Mathematicis.</p>
  <closer><salute><lb/>Interim vale Vir Clarissime et me amare perge.</salute>
<dateline>Dabam
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-2661604" type="place">Basile<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> <date when="1720-04-11">XI<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice> <choice><abbr>April.</abbr><expan>Aprilis</expan></choice> 1720.</date></dateline></closer>
<pb facs="1079155" n="4" type="empty"/>
</div></body></text></TEI>